<title>GERMANY: TABLE-German June WPI falls 0.3 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>TABLE-German June WPI falls 0.3 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES     June 97	May 97	June 96</p>
<p> Monthly change		    -0.3	  +1.7	   +0.2</p>
<p> Yearly change		     +2.6	  +3.1	   -0.8</p>
<p> Index (basis 1991)	     106.7	 107.0	  104.0</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
